---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Artemi collects, uses and protects personal data from visitors and clients.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="c-8 prose">
        <p class="mono muted">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="mono muted">Last updated: <Placeholder note="privacy last-updated date">9 November 2026</Placeholder></p>
        <Placeholder block note="privacy full text (draft, needs legal review)">
          <p>This policy explains what personal data Artemi collects through artemi.in, why we collect it, and the choices you have.</p>
          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Details you give us.</strong> When you request an AI Visibility Report we collect your work email, company website and the competitors you name. When you book a call we receive your name, email and the time you choose.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage data.</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 and Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors use the site, such as pages viewed, clicks and approximate location. Clarity may record anonymised sessions.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>How we use it</h2>
          <p>We use your details to prepare and send your report, to reply to you, to run calls you book, and to improve the site. We do not sell your personal data.</p>
          <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
          <p>We use trusted providers to run the site: Vercel (hosting), Tally (forms), Calendly (scheduling), Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity (analytics). They process data on our behalf under their own privacy terms.</p>
          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>We keep report requests and contact details for as long as needed to respond and follow up, and no longer than 24 months unless you become a client.</p>
          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your personal data, or to stop contacting you, at any time by emailing us.</p>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to Artemi through the contact details on this site.</p>
        </Placeholder>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal { padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px) 0 var(--section); }
  .legal h1 { margin: 16px 0 24px; }
</style>
